  "necessity_paragraph": "The patient presents with recurrent episodes of palpitations and lightheadedness, raising concern for paroxysmal atrial fibrillation in the context of a personal history of transient ischemic attacks and cerebral infarction. Mobile cardiac telemetry is ordered to capture intermittent arrhythmic events and correlate them with symptoms to guide appropriate anticoagulation and rate control management. Given the intermittent nature of these events, precertification cannot be obtained in advance, and the service is medically necessary to document the arrhythmia and support the prior authorization."
